2. Islamic content (adhkar, duas, hadiths)
------------------------------------------
The religious text bundled under assets/data/ (categories.json, adhkar.json,
duas.json, hadiths.json) is drawn from the following public datasets,
reproduced verbatim (including tashkeel) with per-entry source attribution
(reference, kind, authenticity) in the JSON:

- Quran text: Tanzil.net, Uthmani script, obtained through the AlQuran
  Cloud API (quran-uthmani). Distributed unmodified; see
  https://tanzil.net/docs/quran_text for Tanzil's distribution terms.
- Morning/evening adhkar: Seen-Arabic/Morning-And-Evening-Adhkar-DB
  (https://github.com/Seen-Arabic/Morning-And-Evening-Adhkar-DB).
- Hisn al-Muslim duas: rn0x/hisn_almuslim_json
  (https://github.com/rn0x/hisn_almuslim_json).
- Forty hadith an-Nawawi: CheeseWithSauce/HadithsJSONFormat, Sunnah/forty
  (https://github.com/CheeseWithSauce/HadithsJSONFormat).

This content is provided for personal remembrance and study; users should
verify against primary sources for religious rulings.

